{"id":"m1-08-s8","title":"Stage 8: 100M users","scopeHtml":"<p>Scope: multi-AZ, failover, SLOs and error budgets, observability, circuit breakers, bulkheads, deploy safety. Questions are still to be written.</p>","notes":[{"id":"load-and-goal","title":"Load and goal","html":"<p><strong>Stage 8 goal: at 100M registered users, Chirp must stay up when a machine, an AZ, a dependency or a bad deploy fails.</strong> Features are done; reliability is now the product. Downtime of 1 hour at this size touches millions of people and shows up in the news.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Value</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Registered / DAU</td>\n<td>100M / 40M</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Timeline reads</td>\n<td>800M/day = 9,300/s avg, 28k/s peak</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Posts</td>\n<td>20M/day = 230/s avg, 700/s peak</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Revenue at risk</td>\n<td>say $0.05 ARPU/DAU/day = $2M/day = $1,400/min</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Availability target</td>\n<td>99.95% for read paths (22 min/month), 99.9% for posting (43 min/month)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Engineers</td>\n<td>about 200</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<figure class=\"flow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 731.6 192\" width=\"731.6\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Stage 8: three AZs in one region\"><defs><marker id=\"fa\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M102 96 L158 96\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M102 96 L158 96\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.200;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.200;0.201;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M248 96 L304 96\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M248 96 L304 96\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.200;0.400;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.200;0.400;0.401;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M421.6 96 L477.6 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M421.6 96 L477.6 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;0.601;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M421.6 96 L477.6 96\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M421.6 96 L477.6 96\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;0.601;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M421.6 96 L477.6 158\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M421.6 96 L477.6 158\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.400;0.600;0.601;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M567.6 34 L623.6 65\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M567.6 34 L623.6 65\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.600;0.800;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.600;0.800;0.801;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M567.6 96 L623.6 127\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M567.6 96 L623.6 127\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.600;0.800;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.600;0.800;0.801;1\"/></circle><rect x=\"12\" y=\"74\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Users</text><rect x=\"158\" y=\"74\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"203\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Route 53</text><rect x=\"304\" y=\"74\" width=\"117.60000000000001\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"362.8\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Load balancer</text><rect x=\"477.6\" y=\"12\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"522.6\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">AZ-a pods</text><rect x=\"477.6\" y=\"74\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"522.6\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">AZ-b pods</text><rect x=\"477.6\" y=\"136\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"522.6\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">AZ-c pods</text><rect x=\"623.6\" y=\"43\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"671.6\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Primary DB</text><rect x=\"623.6\" y=\"105\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"671.6\" y=\"131\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Standby DB</text></svg><figcaption>Stage 8: three AZs in one region</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>Availability math.</strong> Components in series multiply: 5 dependencies at 99.9% each give 99.5% (3.6 h/month). Parallel redundancy improves: two independent 99.9% copies give 99.9999%. This is why we replicate across AZs and degrade gracefully instead of demanding every dependency be up.</p>\n<p><strong>Industry examples.</strong> Netflix chaos engineering, Google SRE book's SLO and error-budget model, AWS's us-east-1 outage in December 2021 and the 2017 S3 typo are textbook cases of cascading failure.</p>\n<p><strong>Everyday analogy.</strong> A hospital: backup power, more than one operating room, triage so that a busy emergency ward does not stop routine care.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Quoting \"five nines\" with no calculation. 99.999% is 26 s of downtime per month.</li>\n<li>Ignoring that serial dependencies multiply downward.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"configuration","title":"Configuration","html":"<p><strong>Multi-AZ layout (single region, 3 AZs).</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Layer</th>\n<th>Config</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Kubernetes (EKS)</td>\n<td>3 node groups (one per AZ), <code>topologySpreadConstraints</code> maxSkew 1; 150 nodes <code>c6i.2xlarge</code> autoscaled 100 to 300</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Load balancer</td>\n<td>ALB cross-zone enabled, health check <code>/healthz</code> every 5 s, unhealthy after 2 fails, deregistration delay 30 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Postgres shards</td>\n<td>per shard: primary in AZ-a, <strong>synchronous</strong> standby in AZ-b, async replica in AZ-c; Patroni with etcd (3 nodes) for leader election; failover target under 30 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Redis</td>\n<td>each shard: primary and replica in different AZs, <code>min-replicas-to-write 1</code>, Sentinel/Cluster failover under 15 s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kafka</td>\n<td>9 brokers (3 per AZ), RF 3, <code>min.insync.replicas=2</code>, <code>acks=all</code>, rack awareness on</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Elasticsearch</td>\n<td>shards allocation awareness by zone, replicas 1 so a copy lives in another AZ</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Object store</td>\n<td>S3 is multi-AZ by design</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Timeouts and retry budgets.</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Envoy / service client defaults</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">connect_timeout</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">300ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">request_timeout</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">800ms</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          # server-side p99 is 150ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">retries</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  retry_on</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">connect-failure,503</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  # idempotent only</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  per_try_timeout</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">300ms</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  budget</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">10%</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                    # retries cannot exceed 10% of live traffic</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">outlier_detection</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  consecutive_5xx</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  base_ejection_time</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  max_ejection_percent</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span></span></code></pre>\n<p><strong>Circuit breaker:</strong> open when error rate > 50% over 20 requests in 10 s; half-open after 15 s allowing 5 probes. <strong>Bulkheads:</strong> separate thread/connection pools: timeline 200 threads, search 50, notifications 30, media 30; DB pool per downstream so a slow search cannot take every thread.</p>\n<p><strong>Error budget policy.</strong> SLO 99.95% reads over 30 days gives 21.6 min budget. If more than 50% burned, freeze risky releases; if 100% burned, only reliability work until the window recovers.</p>\n<p><strong>Observability stack.</strong> Prometheus + Thanos (metrics, 15 s scrape, 14 d raw, 1 y downsampled), OpenTelemetry traces with 1% head sampling plus 100% of errors and slow requests, Loki or Elasticsearch for logs, Grafana, PagerDuty.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>A synchronous standby in the same AZ as the primary gives no AZ protection.</li>\n<li>Retry without a budget multiplies load 3x in an outage (retry storm).</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"decision-and-why","title":"Decision and why","html":"<p><strong>1. Three AZs, N+1 capacity per AZ.</strong> With 3 AZs, losing one leaves 2/3 capacity, so run each AZ at no more than about 60% so the remaining two absorb the load (3 x 60% = 180% of one-AZ-load; two AZs at 90% handle it briefly). Two AZs would need 100% headroom, which costs more per unit of safety.</p>\n<p><strong>2. Synchronous standby for the DB primary in another AZ.</strong> RPO becomes 0 (no committed write lost) at the cost of +1 to 2 ms commit latency (cross-AZ RTT is about 0.5 to 1 ms). For posts, user data and follow graph that trade is right. For counters and timelines (rebuildable) we accept async.</p>\n<p><strong>3. SLOs, not \"uptime\".</strong> Define SLIs: timeline GET success rate and latency (fraction under 300 ms), post-create success, search success. SLO per journey. Alert on <strong>burn rate</strong> (e.g. 14.4x over 1 h and 6x over 6 h pages; slower burn raises a ticket), not on raw error counts. This is the multi-window multi-burn-rate approach from the Google SRE workbook.</p>\n<p><strong>4. Graceful degradation.</strong> Define what to drop first when overloaded: (1) recommendations and trends, (2) search, (3) notifications delay, (4) counters approximate, (5) timeline stale from cache, (6) posting last. Feature flags and a \"brownout\" switch implement this.</p>\n<p><strong>5. Safe deploys.</strong> Canary 1% for 10 min, then 10%, then 50%, then 100%; automated rollback if error rate delta > 0.5% or p99 +20%. Database changes follow expand-contract: add column (deploy N), write both (N+1), backfill, read new (N+2), drop old (N+3). Feature flags decouple deploy from release.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\"99.99% by adding servers\" while the database remains a single AZ primary.</li>\n<li>Alerting on CPU instead of user-visible symptoms.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"alternatives-branches","title":"Alternatives (branches)","html":"<h3>Branch A: Database failover</h3>\n<figure class=\"flow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 454 192\" width=\"454\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Where the standby lives decides RPO and RTO\"><defs><marker id=\"fa\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M102 96 L158 65\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M102 96 L158 65\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.333;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.333;0.334;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M275.6 65 L331.6 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M275.6 65 L331.6 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.667;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.667;0.668;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M102 96 L158 65\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M102 96 L158 65\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.333;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.333;0.334;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M275.6 65 L331.6 96\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M275.6 65 L331.6 96\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.667;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.667;0.668;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M102 96 L158 127\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M102 96 L158 127\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.333;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.333;0.334;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M275.6 127 L331.6 158\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M275.6 127 L331.6 158\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.667;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"2.4000000000000004s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.667;0.668;1\"/></circle><rect x=\"12\" y=\"74\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Primary</text><rect x=\"158\" y=\"43\" width=\"117.60000000000001\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"216.8\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Sync standby</text><rect x=\"158\" y=\"105\" width=\"117.60000000000001\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"216.8\" y=\"131\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Async replica</text><rect x=\"331.6\" y=\"12\" width=\"110.4\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386.8\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Same AZ</text><rect x=\"331.6\" y=\"74\" width=\"110.4\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386.8\" y=\"100\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Other AZ</text><rect x=\"331.6\" y=\"136\" width=\"110.4\" height=\"44\" rx=\"22\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"386.8\" y=\"162\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Other region</text></svg><figcaption>Where the standby lives decides RPO and RTO</figcaption></figure>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Sync, other AZ</th>\n<th>Async, other AZ</th>\n<th>Sync quorum (Raft/Paxos DB, e.g. CockroachDB, Spanner)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>RPO</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>seconds of loss</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Write latency</td>\n<td>+1 to 2 ms</td>\n<td>none</td>\n<td>+quorum RTT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Failover</td>\n<td>Patroni, 20 to 30 s</td>\n<td>same, plus data loss</td>\n<td>automatic, seconds</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Complexity</td>\n<td>medium</td>\n<td>low</td>\n<td>high, different SQL dialect</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Choose sync standby with Patroni</strong> for now; keep distributed SQL as an option for later.</p>\n<h3>Branch B: Where to stop failure spreading</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<th>What it does</th>\n<th>Chirp use</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Timeout</td>\n<td>bounds waiting</td>\n<td>every call, 300 to 800 ms</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Retry with backoff and jitter</td>\n<td>masks blips</td>\n<td>idempotent calls, 2 tries, budget 10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Circuit breaker</td>\n<td>fails fast to a sick dependency</td>\n<td>search, notifications, recommendations</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Bulkhead</td>\n<td>isolates resource pools</td>\n<td>thread pools per downstream</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Load shedding</td>\n<td>refuses extra work</td>\n<td>return 503 with Retry-After when queue > 100</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Fallback</td>\n<td>degraded answer</td>\n<td>cached timeline when graph service is down</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3>Branch C: Deploy strategy</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Rolling</th>\n<th>Blue/green</th>\n<th>Canary</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Extra capacity</td>\n<td>small</td>\n<td>100%</td>\n<td>small</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rollback speed</td>\n<td>minutes</td>\n<td>seconds (switch)</td>\n<td>seconds</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Risk exposure</td>\n<td>gradual, uncontrolled</td>\n<td>all at once after switch</td>\n<td>measured %</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DB compat needed</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Choose canary with automatic analysis (Argo Rollouts / Flagger)</strong>; use blue/green for the gateway.</p>\n<h3>Branch D: Observability sampling</h3>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>100% traces</th>\n<th>head 1%</th>\n<th>tail-based</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Cost</td>\n<td>very high</td>\n<td>low</td>\n<td>medium, buffer needed</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Catches rare errors</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n<td>misses</td>\n<td>yes</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>Choose head 1% plus tail sampling for errors and p99 slowest</strong> via the OTel collector.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Retrying on every error including non-idempotent POST.</li>\n<li>A circuit breaker with no fallback just converts slow failure to fast failure; decide what the user sees.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"what-breaks-next","title":"What breaks next","html":"<ol>\n<li><strong>Region failure.</strong> We survive an AZ, not a region. Users in Asia see 250 ms latency to the US region (Stage 9).</li>\n<li><strong>Metastable failures.</strong> After an outage the cache is cold; retries plus cold cache keep the DB overloaded even after the cause is gone. Use load shedding and gradual warm-up.</li>\n<li><strong>Alert fatigue.</strong> 200 engineers x many dashboards. Alert only on SLO burn.</li>\n<li><strong>Observability cost.</strong> Metrics cardinality explosion (a label with user_id) can cost $50k/month; cap label cardinality.</li>\n<li><strong>Shard rebalancing</strong> during peak, causing p99 spikes.</li>\n<li><strong>Human error</strong> in config pushes; use staged rollouts for config too, not only code.</li>\n</ol>\n<figure class=\"flow\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 883.6 68\" width=\"883.6\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Typical metastable loop\"><defs><marker id=\"fa\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0 0L10 5L0 10z\" style=\"fill:var(--muted)\"/></marker></defs><path d=\"M102 34 L158 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M102 34 L158 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.167;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.000;0.167;0.168;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M254 34 L310 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M254 34 L310 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.167;0.333;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.167;0.333;0.334;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M413.2 34 L469.2 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M413.2 34 L469.2 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.500;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.333;0.500;0.501;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M559.2 34 L615.2 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M559.2 34 L615.2 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.500;0.667;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.500;0.667;0.668;1\"/></circle><path d=\"M705.2 34 L761.2 34\" style=\"stroke:var(--muted);fill:none\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><circle class=\"flow-dot\" r=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\" opacity=\"0\"><animateMotion dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" path=\"M705.2 34 L761.2 34\" keyPoints=\"0;0;1;1\" keyTimes=\"0;0.667;0.833;1\" calcMode=\"linear\"/><animate attributeName=\"opacity\" dur=\"4.800000000000001s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\" values=\"0;1;1;0;0\" keyTimes=\"0;0.667;0.833;0.834;1\"/></circle><rect x=\"12\" y=\"12\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Outage</text><rect x=\"158\" y=\"12\" width=\"96\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"206\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Cold cache</text><rect x=\"310\" y=\"12\" width=\"103.2\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"361.6\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">DB overload</text><rect x=\"469.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"514.2\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Timeouts</text><rect x=\"615.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"90\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"660.2\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">Retries</text><rect x=\"761.2\" y=\"12\" width=\"110.4\" height=\"44\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--surface);stroke:var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"816.4000000000001\" y=\"38\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"13\" style=\"fill:var(--ink)\">More DB load</text></svg><figcaption>Typical metastable loop</figcaption></figure>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Believing recovery is automatic once the trigger is gone. Plan runbooks and warm-up.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"cost","title":"Cost","html":"<p>Approximate monthly increase from reliability and observability.</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Monthly</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>Capacity headroom: running at 60% instead of 85% adds about 40% compute</td>\n<td>+$60,000 on a $150k fleet</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Extra sync standbys and cross-AZ replicas</td>\n<td>+$35,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cross-AZ data transfer ($0.01/GB each direction; 500 TB/month internal)</td>\n<td>$10,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Observability (metrics, logs 5 TB/day at ~$0.5/GB ingest if SaaS; self-hosted far less)</td>\n<td>$40,000 self-hosted</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>On-call tooling, load testing env</td>\n<td>$5,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Base fleet (core, search, media, CDN)</td>\n<td>about $330,000</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Total</strong></td>\n<td><strong>about $480,000/month, $4.8 per 1,000 registered users</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>Reliability roughly adds 40 to 50% to infrastructure cost. Express this as: each extra nine costs about 10x in effort and 1.3 to 2x in dollars.</p>\n<p><strong>Common interview traps.</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Ignoring cross-AZ transfer fees in a chatty microservice mesh.</li>\n<li>Not tying the SLO to business value; 99.99% is not worth it for a \"who to follow\" widget.</li>\n</ul>"},{"id":"lld-view","title":"LLD view","html":"<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Resilience4j-style composition around the search client</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">CircuitBreakerConfig cb </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CircuitBreakerConfig.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">custom</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">failureRateThreshold</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slidingWindowSize</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">20</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">waitDurationInOpenState</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Duration.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofSeconds</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">permittedNumberOfCallsInHalfOpenState</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">build</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Supplier&#x3C;List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Post</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>> guarded </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Decorators.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ofSupplier</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> search.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">query</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(q))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E